IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wa-interpretation-s5-definitions`

-- Tests for the member lists that pass 2 filled or extended in wa-interpretation-s5-definitions.l4.
-- For each term defined by `means` (the 55 that stored only the word, and the `means` limb of Governor, Her Majesty and Standards
-- Australia): the meaning as printed is listed, each constituent of a list or pair of alternatives is listed, and a thing the
-- section does not give is NOTHING (the list is not complete: a descriptive meaning is stored as its words).  For this group the
-- expected strings are read from the raw text by their own route (split on " means "), not through the module or its generator.
-- For the terms that held a bundle as one string (person, land, penalty, estate, perform, sign, subsidiary legislation) and the
-- `means` terms that already listed constituents but not the printed meaning (amend, court of summary jurisdiction, District Court
-- judge, enactment, judge, written law, Gazette): each new member is listed, the old members still are, and an unlisted thing is
-- NOTHING (FALSE where the list is complete).  For this group the expected strings are typed in the test generator.

§ `Tests -- section 5 meanings and constituents`

-- src:129 | Act means any Act or Ordinance passed by the Parliament of Western Australia, or by any Council previously having authority or power to pass laws in Western Australia, such Act or Ordinance having been assented to by or on behalf of Her Majesty;
@ref s 5 "Act" (src:129)
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "Act" "any Act or Ordinance passed by the Parliament of Western Australia, or by any Council previously having authority or power to pass laws in Western Australia, such Act or Ordinance having been assented to by or on behalf of Her Majesty" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "Act" "a thing the section does not list" EQUALS NOTHING

-- src:130 | affidavit means an affidavit made in accordance with the Oaths, Affidavits and Statutory Declarations Act 2005 or made before the commencement of that Act in accordance with law;
@ref s 5 "affidavit" (src:130)
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "affidavit" "an affidavit made in accordance with the Oaths, Affidavits and Statutory Declarations Act 2005 or made before the commencement of that Act in accordance with law" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "affidavit" "an affidavit made in accordance with the Oaths, Affidavits and Statutory Declarations Act 2005" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "affidavit" "made before the commencement of that Act in accordance with law" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "affidavit" "an affidavit made before the commencement of that Act in accordance with law" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "affidavit" "an unsworn statement" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the definition of the word lists the thing` "affidavit" "a thing the section does not list" EQUALS NOTHING

